    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.poster.avif?t=1751321104\" width=750 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.webm?t=1751321104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.mp4?t=1751321104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>PROJECTA \u2013 Step Into the Rift Between Realities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>PROJECTA</i>, a co-op narrative-driven puzzle-action adventure that thrusts you and your alternate self into a collapsing multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where parallel timelines are fraying, you and your variant must collaborate to restore stability \u2014 or risk becoming echoes of forgotten possibilities. Swap realities, manipulate time, and solve mind-bending spatial challenges as you traverse an ever-shifting world shaped by your choices and your coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.poster.avif?t=1751321104\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.webm?t=1751321104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.mp4?t=1751321104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0c Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Doppelg\u00e4nger Co-Op Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Control or cooperate with your alternate self across split timelines. Work together, or reverse time to undo critical mistakes.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Reality-Shifting Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Navigate rooms that change form between timelines. Solve puzzles that demand memory, timing, and multidimensional thinking.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Time Manipulation Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Rewind, pause, and desync dimensions to escape traps, unlock secrets, and break temporal logic.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Deepening Mystery</strong> \u2013 Discover the truth behind PROJECTA, the interdimensional experiment gone wrong, and face the consequences of fragmented existence.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Stylized Visuals and Dynamic Environments</strong> \u2013 A unique blend of retro-futuristic design and abstract architecture that evolves as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether played solo or with a friend, <i>PROJECTA</i> delivers an intense blend of cerebral gameplay and emotional storytelling. The line between you and your other self is thin and time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/0534f4b2813a19e845af2cc144d7d31d.avif?t=1751321104\" data-has-big width=800 height=282 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/53fa3275b60c625918adb306c90e582c.avif?t=1751321104\" data-has-big width=800 height=159 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.poster.avif?t=1751321104\" width=750 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.webm?t=1751321104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/71f0c04877c518bf354c72bb776a713c.mp4?t=1751321104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>PROJECTA \u2013 Step Into the Rift Between Realities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>PROJECTA</i>, a co-op narrative-driven puzzle-action adventure that thrusts you and your alternate self into a collapsing multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where parallel timelines are fraying, you and your variant must collaborate to restore stability \u2014 or risk becoming echoes of forgotten possibilities. Swap realities, manipulate time, and solve mind-bending spatial challenges as you traverse an ever-shifting world shaped by your choices and your coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.poster.avif?t=1751321104\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.webm?t=1751321104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/16fa61f8d1fcc50d5f68d12156f82df3.mp4?t=1751321104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0c Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Doppelg\u00e4nger Co-Op Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Control or cooperate with your alternate self across split timelines. Work together, or reverse time to undo critical mistakes.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Reality-Shifting Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Navigate rooms that change form between timelines. Solve puzzles that demand memory, timing, and multidimensional thinking.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Time Manipulation Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Rewind, pause, and desync dimensions to escape traps, unlock secrets, and break temporal logic.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Deepening Mystery</strong> \u2013 Discover the truth behind PROJECTA, the interdimensional experiment gone wrong, and face the consequences of fragmented existence.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Stylized Visuals and Dynamic Environments</strong> \u2013 A unique blend of retro-futuristic design and abstract architecture that evolves as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether played solo or with a friend, <i>PROJECTA</i> delivers an intense blend of cerebral gameplay and emotional storytelling. The line between you and your other self is thin and time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/0534f4b2813a19e845af2cc144d7d31d.avif?t=1751321104\" data-has-big width=800 height=282 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739780/extras/53fa3275b60c625918adb306c90e582c.avif?t=1751321104\" data-has-big width=800 height=159 /></span></p>",
